{"id":67439,"date":"2025-07-31T13:31:19","date_gmt":"2025-07-31T12:31:19","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67439"},"modified":"2026-09-27T22:48:26","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T21:48:26","slug":"sao-silvestre-jobra-vila-da-branca","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-jobra-vila-da-branca\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre Jobra\/Vila da Branca 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre Jobra\/Vila da Branca 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre Jobra\/Vila da Branca 2026<\/strong> (3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>26 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, na Vila da Branca, no concelho de <strong>Albergaria-a-Velha<\/strong>, distrito de Aveiro. Promovida pela <strong>JOBRA \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Jovens da Branca<\/strong> com o apoio do Munic\u00edpio de Albergaria-a-Velha e da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Aveiro, a prova celebra a tradi\u00e7\u00e3o das festas natal\u00edcias com corrida de estrada de elevado ritmo.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Tendo como centro nevr\u00e1lgico a pista de atletismo do <strong>Est\u00e1dio Municipal da Branca<\/strong>, onde se situam a partida e a meta, o evento abre \u00e0s 16:30 com as <strong>Corridas Jovens gratuitas<\/strong> para os escal\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o (Benjamins a Juvenis). A corrida principal de <strong>10 km com dist\u00e2ncia certificada<\/strong> arranca \u00e0s 18:00 para Juniores, Seniores e Veteranos, percorrendo as ruas da vila com seguro desportivo e cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">26 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direc